  "description": "Priority A works as per survey 40294 recommendations Tree numbers - G45 - Amelanchier sp. Recommendations - Fell 2x dead trees in row (1x Outside Urban Baristas, 1x Outside Oaktree Interiors). T116 - Magnolia sp. Recommendations - Fell dead Cornus adjacent. Priority B works as per survey 40294 recommendations Tree numbers - \"T19 - Cornelian Cherry (Cornus mas) - Recommendations - Prune by removing around 1m regrowth to shape and tidy. \" \"T20 - Cornelian Cherry (Cornus mas) - Recommendations - Prune by removing around 1m regrowth to shape and tidy. \" \"T22 - Cornus contreversa - Recommendations - Prune to give 0.25m clearance from pergola. Thorough deadwood removal. Remove crossing branches. \" \"G59 - Red Oak (Quercus rubra) - Recommendations - Thorough deadwood removal. Prune to give 0.5m clearance from signage. \" \"T66 - Pin Oak (Quercus palustris) - Recommendations - Reduce crown by around 1m height and 0.5m spread. Thorough deadwood removal.\" \"T71 - Wild Cherry (Prunus avium) - Recommendations - Reduce crown by around 1.5m height and 1m spread.\" \"T72 - Pine (Pinus sylvestris) - Recommendations - Lift crown to give 2m clearance over shrub bed. Through deadwood removal.. \" \"T91 - Paper Birch (Betula papyrifera) - Recommendations - Remove damaged branches on S side. \" \"T118 - Malus sp. - Recommendations - Thorough deadwood removal. Fell dead small tree to W (Amelanchier sp.) \" \"T119 - Malus sp. - Recommendations - Thorough deadwood removal. Prune Eastern side of crown by around 1m to balance and shape. \" \"G127 - Wild Cherry (Prunus avium)and Japanese Maple. - Recommendations - Remove 1x low branch over footpath, branch on northernmost tree. \" \"T134 - Japanese Maple (Acer palmatum) - Recommendations - Sympathetically reduce by around 0.5m to maintain best form.\" Priority C works as per survey 40294 recommendations \"G67 - Persian Ironwood (Parotia persica) & Apple (Malus sp.) - Recommendations - Reduce crowns by around 0.5m back to most recent points. Lift crowns to give",
